CORE
constant-oob-unevaluated.sv
--bound 0
^\[main\.p\] .*: PROVED up to bound 0$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
range-oob
--
A constant out-of-range read in the unselected operand of a constant ?:,
in the unselected branch of a constant if, or after a constant that
decides && or || is not evaluated, and is not reported (as in slang).
